# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` (copy to .dev.vars, which is git-ignored). Never commit real values.
# Generate fresh ones:
#   KMASTER / ACCESS_SECRET:  openssl rand -hex 32
#   WORKER_TOKEN:             openssl rand -base64 48 | tr -d '\n=/+'
#   RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY:      cast wallet new   (a dedicated hot key; fund it with a little Base ETH only)
KMASTER=<64+ hex chars>
ACCESS_SECRET=<64+ hex chars>
WORKER_TOKEN=<at least 32 random chars>
RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x<64 hex chars>

# Optional overrides for local chains (anvil fork of Base, see README "Local interop"):
# RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545
# FACTORY_ADDRESS=0x...
# SELLER_ADDRESS=0x...
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
